This is a placeholder for the multirotor_architecture_handbook.pdf file.
The full substantive technical content, source code references, equations, and diagrams are maintained in markdown format in:
docs/multirotor/multirotor_architecture_handbook.md
You can convert that file to PDF using pandoc/weasyprint or similar converter:
pandoc docs/multirotor/multirotor_architecture_handbook.md -o docs/multirotor/multirotor_architecture_handbook.pdf --pdf-engine=weasyprint
